  "expectation": "Each explicit REF output exports the actual designation through the owning boundary; current consumers follow after owner evaluation. Fresh selector branches sample current captured values. The tree inner retarget changes only right and preserves left binding; outer retarget changes both endpoints, sampling equal-valued left too. The second eval of each case uses fresh graph state.",
