  "surface": "Ordinary scalar eval inputs only; local owning producer plus opaque REF relay plus nested switch owners. Pair tree uses TSB.from_ts. Ordinary scalar/TSB consumers emit deltas to TS[str] observers; no Any recording, raw REF inputs, reference state or empty creation.",
